#: common/newsengine.cpp:214
msgid " <p>The program '%1' was terminated anormally.This can happen if it receives the SIGKILL signal.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Terfynnwyd y rhaglen '%1' yn anarferol.Gall hyn ddigwydd os derbyna'r arwydd SIGKILL.</p>"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:229
msgid "<p>Program output:%1"
msgstr "<p>Allbwn rhaglen:%1"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:231
msgid "An error occured while updating the news source '%1'!"
msgstr "Digwyddodd gwall tra'n ceisio diweddaru'r ffynhonell newyddion '%1'!"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:233
msgid "KNewsTicker error"
msgstr "Gwall KNewsTicker"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:242
msgid "The program '%1' couldn't be started at all."
msgstr "Ni fedrwyd dechrau'r rhaglen '%1' o gwbl."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:243
msgid " The program '%1' tried to read or write a file or directory which couldn't be found."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' ddarllen neu ysgrifennu ffeil neu gyfeiriadur nas canfyddir."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:245
msgid "An error occured while the program '%1' tried to read or write data."
msgstr "Digwyddod gwall tra cheisiodd y rhaglen '%1' ddarllen neu ysgrifennu data."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:247
msgid " The program '%1' was passed too many arguments, please adjust the command line in the configuration dialog."
msgstr "Fe basiwyd gormod o ymresymiadau  i'r raglen '%1', addaswch y linell orchymyn yn yr ymgom ffurfweddu os gwelwch yn dda."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:249
msgid " An external system program upon which the program '%1' relied couldn't be executed."
msgstr "Nid oedd modd gweithredu rhaglen allanol y cysawd y dibynna'r rhaglen '%1' arni."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:251
msgid " The program '%1' tried to read or write a file or directory but lacks the permission to do so."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' ddarllen neu ysgrifennu ffeil neu gyfeiriadur ond nid oes ganddi'r caniatâd i wneud hynny."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:253
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access a device which was not available."
msgstr "Cesiodd y raglen '%1' gyrchu dyfais nad oedd ar gael."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:255
msgid "There is no more space left on the device used by the program '%1'."
msgstr "Nid oes rhagor o le ar ôl ar y ddyfais ddefnyddiwyd gan y raglen '%1'."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:257
msgid " The program '%1' tried to create a temporary file on a read only file system."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' greu ffeil dros dro ar gysawd ffeil darllen-yn-unig."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:259
msgid " The program '%1' tried to call a function which isn't implemented or attempted to access an external resource which does not exist."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' alw ffwythiant sydd heb ei weithredoli neu gyrchu adnodd allanol sydd ddim yn bodoli."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:262
msgid " The program '%1' was unable to retrieve input data and was therefore unable to return any XML data."
msgstr "Methodd y raglen '%1' nôl data mewnbwn ac felly methodd ddychwelyd unrhyw ddata XML."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:264
msgid " The program '%1' tried to access a host which is not connected to a network."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' gyrchu gwesteiwr sydd ddim wedi'i gysylltu â rhwydwaith."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:266
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access a protocol which is not implemented."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' gyrchu protocol sydd heb ei weithredoli."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:268
msgid " The program '%1' requires you to configure a destination address to retrieve data from. Please refer to the documentation of the program for information on how to do that."
msgstr "Mynna'r raglen '%1' eich bod chi'n ffurfweddu cyfeiriad cyrchfan i nôl data oddiwrtho. Cyfeiriwch at ddogfennaeth y rhaglen am wybodaeth am sut i wneud hynny."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:271
msgid " The program '%1' tried to use a socket type which is not supported by this system."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' ddefnyddio math soced nas cynhelir gan y cysawd."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:273
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access an unreachable network."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' gyrchu rhwydwaith anghyraeddadwy."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:275
msgid " The network the program '%1' was trying to access dropped the connection with a reset."
msgstr "Gollyngodd y rwydwaith yr oedd y raglen '%1' yn ceisio ei chyrchu y cysylltiad âg ailosodiad."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:277
msgid "The connection of the program '%1' was reset by peer."
msgstr "Ailosodwyd cysylltiad y raglen '%1' gan gydradd."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:279
msgid "The connection the program '%1' was trying to establish timed out."
msgstr "Goramserodd y cysylltiad yr oedd y raglen '%1' yn ceisio ei sefydlu."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:281
msgid "The connection the program '%1' was trying to establish was refused."
msgstr "Gwrthodwyd y cysylltiad yr oedd y raglen '%1' yn ceisio ei sefydlu."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:283
msgid "The host the program '%1' was trying to reach is down."
msgstr "Mae'r gwesteiwr yr oedd y raglen '%1' yn ceisio cyrchu i lawr."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:285
msgid " The host the program '%1' was trying to reach is unreachable, no route to host."
msgstr "Mae'r gwesteiwr yr oedd y raglen '%1' yn ceisio cyrchu yn anghyraeddadwy. Nid oes llwybr i'r gwesteiwr."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:287
msgid " KNewsTicker couldn't execute the program '%1' because its executable bit wasn't set. You can mark that program as executable by executing the following steps:<ul><li>Open a Konqueror window and browse to the program</ li><li>Click on the file with the right mouse button, and select 'Properties'</li><li>Open the 'Permissions' tab and make sure that the box in the column 'Exec' and the row 'User' is checked to ensure that the current user is allowed to execute that file.</li></ul>"
msgstr "Methodd KNewsTicker weithredu'r raglen '%1' am nad oedd ei did gweithredadwy wedi'i osod. Gallwch nodi'r raglen yna'n gweithredadwy drwy weithredu'r camau canlynol:<ul><li>Agorwch ffenestr  Konqueror a phorwch at y raglen</li><li>Cliciwch ar y ffeil â botwm dde y lygoden, a dewiswch 'Priodweddau'</li><li>Agorwch y tab 'Caniatadau' a sicrhewch bod y blwch yn y golfn 'Gweithr' a'r res 'Defnyddiwr' wedi ei fritho i sicrhau bod gan y defnyddiwr cyfredol ganiatâd i weithredu'r ffeil honno.</li></ul>"

#: common/newsengine.cpp:295
msgid " The program '%1' sent a bad request which wasn't understood by the server."
msgstr "Anfonodd y raglen '%1' gais gwael nas deallwyd gan y gweinydd."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:297
msgid " The program '%1' failed to issue an authorization for an area which needs some form of authorization before it can be accessed."
msgstr "Methodd y raglen '%1' gyhoeddi awdurdodiad ar gyfer maes lle bo angen awdurdodi cyn ei gyrchu."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:300
msgid " The program '%1' aborted because it couldn't access the data without paying for it."
msgstr "Erthylodd y raglen '%1' gan nad oedd modd gyrchu'r data heb dalu amdano."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:302
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access a forbidden source."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' gyrchu ffynhonell waharddedig."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:304
msgid "The program '%1' tried to access data which couldn't be found."
msgstr "Ceisiodd y raglen '%1' gyrchu data nad oedd modd ei ganfod."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:306
msgid "The HTTP request of the program '%1' timed out."
msgstr "Goramserodd cais HTTP y raglen '%1'."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:307
msgid " A server error has been encountered. It's likely that you can't do anything about it."
msgstr "Daethpwyd ar draws gwall gweinydd. Mae'n debyg nad oes dim y gallwch wneud amdano."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:309
msgid " The HTTP protocol version used by the program '%1' was not understood by the HTTP server or source."
msgstr "Ni ddeallwyd fersiwn y protocol HTTP a ddefnyddwyd gan y raglen '%1' gan y gweinydd HTTP neu'r ffynhonell."

#: common/newsengine.cpp:311
msgid "KNewsTicker was unable to detect the exact reasons for the error."
msgstr "Methodd KNewsTicker ddarganfod rhesymau manwl am y gwall."

